  "slug": "coleslaw-with-grapes-and-spinach",
  "name": "Coleslaw With Grapes and Spinach",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "Red grapes are the surprise ingredient in a sweet, tangy, and colorful coleslaw made with broccoli, spinach, and red onion.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Whisk mayonnaise, sugar, vinegar, salt, and black pepper in a large salad bowl; fold in cabbage, broccoli, red onion, spinach, and red grapes. Stir to coat with dressing."
    }
  ],
